## Documents
The documents are labelled D1, D2, … and are shown from oldest to latest, each with its date.
When a later document explicitly restates, amends or replaces a value from an earlier one, report only the
later value. When documents merely disagree, with no sign that one replaces the other, report both values.

## Rules
- Answer with one entry per field that you found, using the field labels (F1, F2, …). Omit fields you did
  not find; never return null.
- Give each value as a separate candidate, with at least one evidence entry: the document label (D1, …)
  and a quote copied **verbatim** from that document. Do not paraphrase or translate quotes.
- Return each value already in the format shown above; the system normalises it again afterwards.
- `rationale`: one short sentence on why the quote supports the value.
- `confidence`: a number from 0 to 1.
